<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="SNG" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Marafanna Falane Sora</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muluku Sulemani Fala Ɲaxumɛn Naxanye Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Marafanna Falane</para>
  <para style="mt1">Marafanna Falane</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muluku Sulemani Fala Ɲaxumɛn Naxanye Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Xɛmɛn nun a ɲaxanla e bode xanuma kii naxan yi, Ala nan na feen nagidixi adamadiine ma. Na feen sɛbɛxi Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn sora 2.23-25 kui. Xanuntenya sigine nun fala ɲaxumɛne nan sɛbɛxi Kitabun yireni ito yi lan xɛmɛn nun a ɲaxanla marafanna fe ma. Yanyina nde, Muluku Sulemani nun a ɲaxanla nan falani itoe sɛbɛxi e bode ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabun yireni ito kui, xɛmɛn nun ɲaxanla marafanna falane nan tima e bode tagi. Yirena ndee, e bode fenma, e yi e bode to, e lɔ ayi e bode ma, e lu e bode fenɲɛ fala ɲaxumɛne yi. Muxu gbɛtɛne falane fan sɛbɛxi alogo falan xa ɲaxun.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muxuna ndee bata Kitabun yireni ito xaran misaala ra, wundo falan naxan xanuntenyana fe yɛbama lan Ala nun a yamaan tagin ma.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="SNG 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 1:1"/>Sulemani a sigi fisamantenna.<verse eid="SNG 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xanuntenyana</para>
  <para style="sp">Ɲaxanla falana a xɛmɛn xa:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 1:2"/>N sunbu marafan sunbuni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:2">Amasɔtɔ i ya xanuntenyaan ɲaxun dangu manpaan na.<verse eid="SNG 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 1:3"/>I ya latikɔnɔnna xirin ɲaxun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:3">I xinla luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:3">alo latikɔnɔnna naxan xiri sigama ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:3">Nanara, i rafan sungutunne ma.<verse eid="SNG 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 1:4"/>N suxu n yiin ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">En na en gi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">Mangan bata n xali a konni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">Nxu ɲaxanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">nxu sɛwa i ya fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">nxu i ya xanuntenyaan matɔxɔma nɛn dangu manpaan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">Yoon sungutunne xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">i rafan e ma!<verse eid="SNG 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 1:5"/>Yerusalɛn sungutunne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:5">n fatin nan gbeelixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:5">koni n nayabu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:5">alo Kedari kaane bubu fɔrɛne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:5">alo Sulemani a dugin naxanye singanxi a banxini.<verse eid="SNG 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 1:6"/>Koni, i nama n mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">n to gbeelixi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">Sogen nan n fatin gbeelixi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">Ngaa dii xɛmɛne nan xɔlɔxi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">e yi n findi manpa bili nakɔ kantanna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">Koni n mi n yengi luxi n yɛtɛna nakɔɔn xɔn.<verse eid="SNG 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 1:7"/>A fala n xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">i tan naxan nafan n ma n bɔɲɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">i fa i ya xuruse kurun nabama dɛnaxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">hanma i e luma dɛnaxan yi yanyi tagini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">alogo n nama lu i fenɲɛ na xun xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">alo ɲaxalan kobina</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">i xɔyine xuruse kurune dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="SNG 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Xɔyine falana:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 1:8"/>Xa i mi na kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:8">i tan naxan tofan ɲaxanle birin xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:8">siga i ya sii diine rabɛ yɛxɛɛ kurune funfun xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:8">xuruse kantanne bubune dɛxɔn.<verse eid="SNG 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Xɛmɛna falana a ɲaxanla xa:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 1:9"/>N nafan ɲaxanla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:9">i luxi nɛn n yɛɛ ra yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:9">alo soo gilɛ faɲin naxanye Misiran mangana yɛngɛ so wontoron bandunma.<verse eid="SNG 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 1:10"/>I xadene rayabu tunlasone longonna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:10">i kɔɛɛn nayabu ɲɛrɛni.<verse eid="SNG 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 1:11"/>En tunlaso xɛma daxine rafalama nɛn i xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:11">naxanye rayabuxi gbeti wuredine ra.<verse eid="SNG 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Ɲaxanla falana a xɛmɛn xa:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 1:12"/>Mangan yi a dɛgema waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:12">n ma latikɔnɔnna xiri faɲin yi sigama a ma.<verse eid="SNG 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 1:13"/>N nafan muxun luxi nɛn n xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:13">alo mirihi latikɔnɔnna se sa seen kui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:13">naxan singanxi n xiɲɛ longonna ra.<verse eid="SNG 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 1:14"/>N nafan muxun luxi n xa nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:14">alo se fuge faɲine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:14">keli manpa bili nakɔne yi En-Gedi yamanani.<verse eid="SNG 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Xɛmɛna falana a ɲaxanla xa:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 1:15"/>I rayabu, n nafan ɲaxanla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:15">i rayabu han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:15">I yɛɛne rayabu alo ganbane.<verse eid="SNG 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Ɲaxanla falana a xɛmɛn xa:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 1:16"/>N xanuntenna, i tofan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:16">i rayabu han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:16">En saden findixi sɛxɛ xindene nan na.<verse eid="SNG 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="SNG 1:17"/>Suman yiine nan en xunna soon na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:17">fɔfɔ binle yi findi banxi kankene ra en xa.<verse eid="SNG 1:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="SNG 2"/>
  <para style="s">Xɛmɛn nun ɲaxanla tofanna</para>
  <para style="sp">Ɲaxanla falana a xɛmɛn xa:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 2:1"/>N luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:1">alo se fuge faɲin naxanye Sarɔn yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:1">gabala fugene mɛrɛmɛrɛne yi.<verse eid="SNG 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Xɛmɛna falana a ɲaxanla xa:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 2:2"/>N nafan ɲaxanla luxi sungutunne tagi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:2">alo gabala fugen sɛxɛ ɲali kanne tagi.<verse eid="SNG 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Ɲaxanla falana a xɛmɛn xa:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 2:3"/>N nafan xɛmɛn luxi banxulanne tagi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">alo mangon binla fɔtɔn yi wudine tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">A rafan n ma n dɔxɔ a nininna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">a rafan n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">alo wudi bogi ɲaxumɛna n dɛ.<verse eid="SNG 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 2:4"/>A bata n xali sumun yireni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:4">A xanuntenyaan luxi nɛn n xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:4">alo taxamasenna.<verse eid="SNG 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 2:5"/>Ɛ n sɛnbɛ so se bogine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:5">ɛ yi n bɔɲɛn maxunbeli mangon bogine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:5">bayo xanuntenyaan furena n ma.<verse eid="SNG 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 2:6"/>A kɔmɛn ma yiina n xunna bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:6">a yi a yiifanna rabilin n ma.<verse eid="SNG 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 2:7"/>Yerusalɛn sungutunne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:7">n bata ɛ rakɔlɔ bolene nun burunna xɛnle yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:7">ɛ nama xanuntenyaan nakeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:7">ɛ nama a raxulun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:7">benun a waxatin xa a li.<verse eid="SNG 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 2:8"/>N bata n xanuntenna xuiin mɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:8">A fama tuganɲɛ ayi geyane xun tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:8">a a gima yire matexine xun tagi.<verse eid="SNG 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 2:9"/>N xanuntenna a gima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">alo bolena hanma xɛli sɛnbɛmana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">A mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">a tixi en konna sansanna xanbi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">A yɛɛn nasoma banxin foyesoden na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">a yɛɛ masama wure sansanna yinle ra.<verse eid="SNG 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 2:10"/>N xanuntenna falan tima n xa, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:10">“Keli, n xanunten tofaɲina, fa en siga!<verse eid="SNG 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 2:11"/>Bayo ɲɛmɛn ɲanmatɔɔn ni i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:11">tulen bata ɲan, a bata siga.<verse eid="SNG 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 2:12"/>Se fuge faɲine bata wara ayi bɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:12">sigi sa waxatin bata a li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:12">kolokondene xuiin minima burunna ra.<verse eid="SNG 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 2:13"/>Xɔdɛ binla bata a bogi singene ramini fɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:13">manpa binle<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wudi binla nde na yi, mɛn kaane naxanye sima, e yi naxanye bogi yitɔnma alo manpana e gbee kiini.</char></note> bata fuga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:13">e xiri faɲin naminima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:13">N xanuntenna, keli, fa en siga.”<verse eid="SNG 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Xɛmɛna falana a ɲaxanla xa:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 2:14"/>N ma ɲaxanla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">i nama i luxun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">alo ganbana gɛmɛ yinle ra geyaan kanke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">I yɛtagin yita n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">i xuiin namini n xa a mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">amasɔtɔ i xuiin ɲaxun, i tofan.<verse eid="SNG 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Xɛmɛna falana a muxune xa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 2:15"/>Ɛ xulumaseene suxu nxu xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:15">xulumase xurin naxanye nxɔ manpa bili fugaxine kalama.<verse eid="SNG 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Ɲaxanla falana a xɛmɛn xa:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 2:16"/>N gbeen nan n xanuntenna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:16">a fan gbeen nan n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:16">a nɛma a xuruseene rabama sansi fugaxine tagi.<verse eid="SNG 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="SNG 2:17"/>N xanuntenna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:17">benun kuye xa yiba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:17">dimin yi siga, xɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:17">i i gi alo bolena</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:17">alo xɛli sɛnbɛmaan gɛmɛ geyane fari.<verse eid="SNG 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="SNG 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ɲaxanla xiye sana a xɛmɛn fen feen na</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 3:1"/>N nɛma saxi n ma saden ma kɔɛɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:1">n kataxi n xanuntenna to feen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:1">n na a fenma, koni n mi a toma.<verse eid="SNG 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 3:2"/>Nayi, n kelima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:2">n yi taan nabilin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:2">n yi siga taan yama malandene nun kirane xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:2">n yi n bɔɲɛn nafan muxun fen.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:2">N na a fenma, koni n mi a toma.<verse eid="SNG 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 3:3"/>Taan kantan muxune yi fa n li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:3">n yi e maxɔdin, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:3">“Ɛ mi n bɔɲɛn nafan muxun toxi ba?”<verse eid="SNG 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 3:4"/>N dangu e ra nɛn tun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">n yi n bɔɲɛn nafan muxun to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">n yi a suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">n mi fa a beɲin sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">han n yi sa a raso ngaa banxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">nga fudi tongo n na dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="SNG 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 3:5"/>Yerusalɛn sungutunne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:5">n bata ɛ rakɔlɔ bolene nun burunna xɛnle yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:5">ɛ nama xanuntenyaan nakeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:5">ɛ nama a raxulun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:5">benun a waxatin xa a li.<verse eid="SNG 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 3:6"/>Nde ito ra naxan kelima tonbonni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:6">naxan tema alo tutina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:6">alo mirihi nun wusulanna xirina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:6">e nun latikɔnɔnna xiri ɲaxumɛn sifan birin?<verse eid="SNG 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 3:7"/>Sulemani maxali saden nan a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:7">sofa tonge sennin a rabilinxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:7">Isirayila sofa kɛndɛne nan e birin na.<verse eid="SNG 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 3:8"/>Silanfanna e birin yii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.8</char> <char style="fk">Silanfanna:</char> Sofane yɛngɛso dɛgɛmana.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:8">e birin darixi yɛngɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:8">Silanfanna xidixi e birin tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:8">alogo e xa makantanna ti kɔɛɛn na.<verse eid="SNG 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 3:9"/>Manga Sulemani a saden nafalaxi Liban yamanan wudine nan na.<verse eid="SNG 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 3:10"/>A bun tiine rafalaxi wure gbetin nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:10">xɛmaan nan a bundɔxɔn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:10">Yerusalɛn sungutunne a dɔxɔ seen nafalaxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:10">dugi mamiloxin nan na xanuntenyani.<verse eid="SNG 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 3:11"/>Ɛ mini, Siyon taan sungutunne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">ɛ Manga Sulemani nun a manga kɔmɔtin mato</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">a nga naxan soxi a xun na a ɲaxalandin mati lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">a bɔɲɛn sɛwa lɔxɔna.<verse eid="SNG 3:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="SNG 4"/>
  <para style="s">Xɛmɛna ɲaxanla luxi nɛn alo a nakɔ yirena</para>
  <para style="sp">Xɛmɛna falana a ɲaxanla xa:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 4:1"/>I rayabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">n nafan ɲaxanla, i rayabu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">I yɛɛne rayabu alo ganbane</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">hali dugin soxi i yɛtagin xun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">I xun sɛxɛn saxi a ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">alo sii kurun nɛma godɛ Galadi geyaan ma.<verse eid="SNG 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 4:2"/>I ɲinne fixa alo yɛxɛɛ kurun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">naxan xabe baxi maxabadeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">naxanye kelima e maxadeni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.2</char> Mɛn kaane yɛxɛɛne <char style="fk">xaben</char> gbo nɛn han! A nɔɛ findɛ dugin na.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">E lanxi e boden ma firin firin yɛɛn ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">alo gulunne, e keden pe mi baxi.<verse eid="SNG 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 4:3"/>I dɛ kidine luxi alo luti gbeela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:3">i dɛɛn tofan han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:3">I xaden nayabu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:3">alo girenada wudi bogini xabaxina a tagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:3">hali dugin bata so i yɛtagin xun na.<verse eid="SNG 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 4:4"/>I kɔɛɛn maxidixi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:4">alo Dawudaa sangansona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:4">sofane yɛngɛ so wure lefa wuli kedenna singanxi naxan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:4">alo ɲɛrɛna i kɔɛ ra.<verse eid="SNG 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 4:5"/>I xiɲɛ firinne rayabu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:5">alo bolen dii gulun firinne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:5">naxanye e dɛgema sansi fugaxine tagi.<verse eid="SNG 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 4:6"/>N sigama nɛn na mirihi latikɔnɔnna nun wusulanna yireni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:6">han kuye yiba, dimin yi siga.<verse eid="SNG 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 4:7"/>N xanuntenna, i rayabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:7">fɛ yo mi i ra.<verse eid="SNG 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 4:8"/>N ma ɲaxalandi masuxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">fa n fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">keli Liban yamanani Amana geyaan xuntagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">Xerimon geyaan nun Seniri geyaan xuntagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">yatane xiin dɛnaxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">burunna ɲarine geyane.<verse eid="SNG 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 4:9"/>I n bɔɲɛn nadinma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:9">i tan sungutunna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:9">n ma ɲaxalan masuxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:9">i na i yɛɛn ti n na keden pe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:9">i n bɔɲɛn nadinma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:9">Hali i ya ɲɛrɛn xɔri keden pe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:9">a na ligɛ n na.<verse eid="SNG 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 4:10"/>I ya xanuntenyaan ɲaxun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:10">i tan sungutunna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:10">n ma ɲaxalan masuxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:10">i ya xanuntenyaan ɲaxun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:10">dangu manpa faɲin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:10">i ya latikɔnɔnna xirin ɲaxun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:10">dangu se xiri ɲaxumɛne birin na.<verse eid="SNG 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 4:11"/>N ma ɲaxalan masuxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:11">i dɛɛn ɲaxun alo kumina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:11">nɔnɔn nun kumin nan i lɛnna bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:11">i ya dugine xirin luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:11">alo Liban wudi xiri ɲaxumɛne.<verse eid="SNG 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 4:12"/>I tan sungutunna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:12">n ma ɲaxalan masuxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:12">i luxi nɛn alo n ma nakɔ masansanxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:12">n ma tigina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:12">n ma ige miniden naxan namaraxi n keden peen xa.<verse eid="SNG 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 4:13"/>I fan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:13">alo sansi faɲin sixi nakɔɔn naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:13">alo girenada binla</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:13">naxanye bogi faɲine raminima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:13">e nun henna binle</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:13">nun naradi sansi xiri faɲina,<verse eid="SNG 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 4:14"/>naradin nun sansi fuge nɛri fuɲiramaan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:14">nun gbala xiri ɲaxumɛne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:14">nun sinamon wudi xiri ɲaxumɛne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:14">e nun wusulanna kelixi wudin naxanye birin ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:14">e nun mirihi latikɔnɔnna nun wudi ige xiri ɲaxumɛne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:14">nun sansi xiri ɲaxumɛ faɲine birin.<verse eid="SNG 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 4:15"/>I luxi nɛn alo nakɔ yi tigina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:15">alo xude xunna naxan godoma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:15">keli Liban geyane ma.<verse eid="SNG 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Ɲaxanla falana a xɛmɛn xa:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 4:16"/>Foye faɲin xa fa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">sa keli kɔmɛnna nun yiifanna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">e yi n ma nakɔɔn xiri faɲin nasiga ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">alogo n nafan muxun xa fa so a nakɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">a yi a bogise faɲine don!<verse eid="SNG 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="SNG 5"/>
  <para style="s">Xɛmɛna tofanna</para>
  <para style="sp">Xɛmɛna falana a ɲaxanla xa:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 5:1"/>N fama n ma nakɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">i tan sungutunna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">n ma ɲaxalan masuxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">n xa sa n ma mirihi latikɔnɔnna nun wusulanna ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">n yi n ma kumi dɛngbɛn nun kumin don,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">n yi n ma manpaan nun n ma nɔnɔn min.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="SNG 5:1"/>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 5:1">Xɔyine falana:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">Nxu xɔyine, ɛ min,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">ɛ xunne xa magi a ra xanuntenyani.<verse eid="SNG 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Ɲaxanla xiyen naxan saxi lan a xɛmɛn ma:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 5:2"/>N bata yi xi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">koni n bɔɲɛn mi yi xima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">N yi n xanuntenna xuiin nan mɛma dɛɛn na.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="SNG 5:2"/>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 5:2">Xɛmɛna falana a ɲaxanla xa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">Dɛɛn nabi n xa, i tan sungutunna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">n ma ɲaxalandi masuxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">n ma ganbadina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">fɛ mi ɲaxanla naxan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">Xiila bata n xunni kun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">n xun sɛxɛn bata yikun kɔɛ ra kundaan bun.<verse eid="SNG 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Ɲaxanla falana a xɛmɛn xa:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 5:3"/>N bata n ma domaan ba n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:3">n fa a ragodoma n ma di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:3">N baxi n sanne maxadeni nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:3">n fa e malɔxɔma di?<verse eid="SNG 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 5:4"/>N xanuntenna bata a yiin naso dɛɛn yalenna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:4">n fatin yi xuruxurun.<verse eid="SNG 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 5:5"/>N to keli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:5">n xa dɛɛn nabi n xanuntenna xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:5">mirihi latikɔnɔnna yi n yiine nun yii sonle ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:5">han a lu dindinɲɛ bɔxɔni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:5">e nun dɛɛn balan seen ma.<verse eid="SNG 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 5:6"/>N yi dɛɛn nabi n xanuntenna xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">koni n xanuntenna bata yi a xun xanbi so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">a dangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">A fala xuiin yi godoma n niini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">n yi a fen, n mi a to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">n yi a xili han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">koni a mi n yabi.<verse eid="SNG 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 5:7"/>Kantan tiin naxanye taan nabilinma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">ne yi fa n li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">e yi n bɔnbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">e yi n maxɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">e yi n ma xunbeli domaan ba n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">e tan naxanye taan nabilinna yinna kantanma.<verse eid="SNG 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 5:8"/>Yerusalɛn sungutunne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:8">ɛ kɔlɔ n xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:8">Xa ɛ n xanuntenna to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:8">ɛ nanse falama a xa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:8">Ɛ a fala a xa, fa fala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:8">a fe xanuntenyaan furena n ma.<verse eid="SNG 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Xɔyine falana:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 5:9"/>I tan ɲaxanla</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:9">naxan tofan ɲaxanle birin xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:9">i xanuntenna fan e birin xa di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:9">I xanuntenna fisa gbɛtɛye xa kiin mundun yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:9">naxan a ligaxi i nxu rakɔlɔma na kiini?<verse eid="SNG 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Ɲaxanla falan lan a xɛmɛn ma:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 5:10"/>N xanuntenna fatin fixa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:10">a gbeeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:10">a rayabu muxu wuli fuun yɛ.<verse eid="SNG 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 5:11"/>A xunna luxi alo xɛma kɛndɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:11">a xunsɛxɛne saxi a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:11">e fɔrɔ alo xaxaan xabena.<verse eid="SNG 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 5:12"/>A yɛɛne rayabu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:12">alo ganbane xuden dɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:12">E fixa alo nɔnɔna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:12">e mayilenma alo dayimuna.<verse eid="SNG 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 5:13"/>A xadene luxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:13">alo sansi xiri ɲaxumɛ nakɔna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:13">naxanye xiri ɲaxumɛn tema.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:13">A dɛ kidine luxi alo gabala fugene</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:13">mirihi latikɔnɔnna minima dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="SNG 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 5:14"/>A yiine rayabu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:14">alo yiiraso xɛma daxin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:14">naxanye rayabuxi kirisoliti gɛmɛ faɲine ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:14">A fatin luxi alo sama ɲin xuruxina</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:14">safiri gɛmɛ faɲin saxin naxan ma.<verse eid="SNG 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 5:15"/>A sanne luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:15">alo sɛnbɛtɛn gɛmɛ fixɛ daxin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:15">naxanye tixi xɛma faɲin fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:15">A tofan alo Liban yamanana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:15">a tixi alo sumanna.<verse eid="SNG 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 5:16"/>Ɲaxunna nan tun a dɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">a fatin birin nayabu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">N xanuntenna na kii nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">n fɔxɔrabiran na kii nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">ɛ tan Yerusalɛn sungutunne.<verse eid="SNG 5:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="SNG 6"/>
  <para style="s">Ɲaxanla tofanna</para>
  <para style="sp">Xɔyine falana:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 6:1"/>I tan ɲaxanla</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:1">naxan tofan birin xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:1">i xanuntenna sigaxi minɛn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:1">I xanuntenna a xun tixi minɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:1">alogo nxu fan xa sa a fen i xa?<verse eid="SNG 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Ɲaxanla falana:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 6:2"/>N xanuntenna bata siga a nakɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:2">sansi xiri ɲaxumɛ yireni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:2">alogo a xa a xuruseene raba mɛnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:2">a yi sansi fugaxina ndee malan.<verse eid="SNG 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 6:3"/>N xanuntenna gbeen nan n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:3">n fan gbeen nan a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:3">a nɛma a xuruseene rabama sansi fugaxine tagi.<verse eid="SNG 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Xɛmɛna falana a ɲaxanla xa:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 6:4"/>N nafan ɲaxanla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:4">i rayabu alo Tirisa taana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:4">i rayabu alo Yerusalɛn taana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:4">koni i magaxu alo sofa ganla.<verse eid="SNG 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 6:5"/>I yɛɛn ba n na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:5">alogo e nama n xaxinli fu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:5">I xunsɛxɛn saxi a ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:5">alo sii kurun nɛma godɛ Galadi geyaan na.<verse eid="SNG 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 6:6"/>I ɲinne fixa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:6">alo yɛxɛɛ kurun naxanye kelima e maxadeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:6">E lanxi e boden ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:6">firin firin yɛɛn ma alo gulunne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:6">E keden pe mi baxi e bode ma.<verse eid="SNG 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 6:7"/>I xaden nayabu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:7">alo girenada wudi bogini xabaxina a tagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:7">hali dugin bata so i yɛtagin xun na.<verse eid="SNG 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 6:8"/>Mangan nɔɛ ɲaxalan manga tonge sennin sɔtɛ nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:8">e nun konyi ɲaxalan tonge solomasɛxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:8">e nun sungutun wuyaxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:8">naxanye xasabi mi nɔɛ kolonɲɛ,<verse eid="SNG 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 6:9"/>koni n tan ɲaxalan keden peen nan kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">N ma ganbadin na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">fɛ mi ɲaxanla naxan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">A keden peen nan a nga yii dii tɛmɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">A nga a tan nan nafisaxi a diine birin xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">Sungutunne to a to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">e a sɛwana fe fala nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">mangana ɲaxanle nun mangana konyi ɲaxanle fan yi a matɔxɔ.<verse eid="SNG 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 6:10"/>E naxa, “Nde ito ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:10">naxan fama alo subaxana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:10">a rayabu alo kikena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:10">a mayilenma alo sogena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:10">koni a magaxu alo sofa ganla?”<verse eid="SNG 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 6:11"/>N bata siga nakɔni kantin yireni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:11">alogo n xa sa se solixine mato xuden dɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:11">alogo n xa a to xa manpa binle maɲingima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:11">xa girenada wudine bata fuga.<verse eid="SNG 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 6:12"/>Anu n mi a kolon naxan a ligaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:12">n fa n yɛtɛ rasoxi yamaan kuntigine yɛngɛ so wontorone tagi.<verse eid="SNG 6:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="SNG 7"/>
  <para style="s">Ɲaxanla nun xɛmɛna xanuntenyana</para>
  <para style="sp">Xɔyine falana:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 7:1"/>I xun xɛtɛ, i xun xɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">i tan Sulami kaana!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">I xun xɛtɛ, i xun xɛtɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">alogo nxu xa i mato.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">Nanfera i Sulami kaan matoma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">alo gali firinna nɛma e bodonma?<verse eid="SNG 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Xɛmɛna falana a ɲaxanla xa:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 7:2"/>I sanne rayabu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:2">i ya sankidine kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:2">i tan xɔrɔ ɲaxanla!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:2">I danbane rayabu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:2">alo yiirafalan ɲɛrɛn naxan nafalaxi.<verse eid="SNG 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 7:3"/>I xuli fundin luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:3">alo lenge radigilinxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:3">minse xiri ɲaxumɛn mi ɲanma dɛnaxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:3">I kuiin luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:3">alo murutu malanxina</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:3">naxan nabilinxi gabala fugene ra.<verse eid="SNG 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 7:4"/>I xiɲɛ firinne luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:4">alo bolen dii gulun firinne.<verse eid="SNG 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 7:5"/>I kɔɛɛn mɛrɛndɛnxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">alo sanganso sama ɲin daxina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">I yɛɛne mayilenma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">alo Xɛsibɔn dara igena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">Bati-Rabimi so dɛɛn dɛxɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">I ɲɔɛɛn fan alo Liban sangansoon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">naxan tixi Damasi taan binni.<verse eid="SNG 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 7:6"/>I xunna ratinxinxi i gbindin dɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:6">alo Karemele geyana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:6">i xun sɛxɛne mayilenma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:6">alo mangane dugi mamiloxine.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:6">Mangan mi nɔɛ a yɛɛn bɛ e ra.<verse eid="SNG 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 7:7"/>I rayabu, i tofan han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:7">n xanuntenna, n ma sɛwa xunna.<verse eid="SNG 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 7:8"/>I kuya alo tugu binla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:8">i xiɲɛne luxi alo tugu bogi tɔnsɔnne.<verse eid="SNG 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 7:9"/>Nanara, n na a falama, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:9">“N tema nɛn tugu binla kɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:9">n yi a bogine suxu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:9">I xiɲɛne luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:9">alo ɲaxundan tɔnsɔnne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:9">i dɛ foyen xirin luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:9">alo mangon mɔɛɛn xirina.<verse eid="SNG 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 7:10"/>I dɛɛn xirin luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:10">alo manpa xiri ɲaxumɛna.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="SNG 7:10"/>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 7:10">Ɲaxanla falana a xɛmɛn xa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:10">Na manpaan xa lu n xanuntenna nan xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:10">a godo a dɛ kidine nun a ɲinne ma.<verse eid="SNG 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 7:11"/>N xanuntenna nan gbee n na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:11">a waxi n tan nan xɔn.<verse eid="SNG 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 7:12"/>N xanuntenna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:12">fa en siga burunna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:12">en kɔɛne radangu banxidɛne ra.<verse eid="SNG 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 7:13"/>Xɔtɔnni en kurun sigɛ manpa bili nakɔne yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">en sa a mato</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">xa e solima, xa e fugama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">xa girenada binle fugama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">Mɛnni, n sa n ma xanuntenyaan yita i ra.<verse eid="SNG 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 7:14"/>Marafan bogi binle e xiri faɲine raminima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:14">bogise faɲine birin en dɛxɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:14">N xanuntenna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:14">n fe faɲine birin namaraxi i tan nan xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:14">a fonne nun a nɛnɛne.<verse eid="SNG 7:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="SNG 8"/>
  <para style="s">Xanuntenyaan sɛnbɛn gbo</para>
  <para style="sp">Ɲaxanla falana a xɛmɛn xa:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 8:1"/>Xa ngaxakeden xɛmɛmaan nan yi i ra nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:1">naxan nga xiɲɛn minxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:1">n yi sa i ralanma nɛn nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:1">n yi i sunbu tanden ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:1">muxu yo mi n naɲaxu.<verse eid="SNG 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 8:2"/>N yi i xalima nɛn nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:2">n sa i raso ngaa banxini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:2">I yi n xaran xanuntenyaan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:2">I yi n ma manpa xiri ɲaxumɛn min,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:2">n ma girenada bogine igene.<verse eid="SNG 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 8:3"/>A kɔmɛn ma yiina n xunna bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:3">a yi a yiifanna rabilin n ma.<verse eid="SNG 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 8:4"/>Yerusalɛn sungutunne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:4">n bata ɛ rakɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:4">ɛ nama xanuntenyaan nakeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:4">ɛ nama a raxulun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:4">benun a waxatin xa a li.<verse eid="SNG 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Xɔyine falana:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 8:5"/>Ɲaxanla mundun fama ito ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">sa keli tonbonni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">a singanxi a xanuntenna ra?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="SNG 8:5"/>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 8:5">Ɲaxanla falana a xɛmɛn xa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">N bata i raxulun mangon binla bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">i bari ngana i fudi tongoxi dɛnaxan yɛtɛni.<verse eid="SNG 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 8:6"/>N ma fe sa i bɔɲɛni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">alo taxamasenna i yiin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">bayo xanuntenyaan sɛnbɛn gbo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">alo sayana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">Xɔxɔlɔnna ɲaxu alo laxira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">a dɛgɛn xɔlɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">alo habadan tɛɛ dɛgɛna.<verse eid="SNG 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 8:7"/>Ige gbeene mi nɔɛ xanuntenyaan ɲanɲɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">Baa igene mi nɔɛ a xalɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">Xa muxuna nde yi katɛ a banxin kui seene birin masarɛ xanuntenyaan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">muxe mi yi tinɲɛ a rasuxɛ.<verse eid="SNG 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Xɔyine falana:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 8:8"/>Nxu xunyɛ ɲaxalanmana nde na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:8">naxan xiɲɛye munma te singen.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:8">En nanse ligama en xunyɛ ɲaxalanmaan xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:8">en na a futu feen fala lɔxɔn naxan yi?<verse eid="SNG 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 8:9"/>Xa a luxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">alo taan nabilinna yinna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">naxan mi rabima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">nxu a binyama nɛn gbeti gbeen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">Koni xa a luxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">alo dɛɛn naxan nabima keden na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">nxu a balanma suman farinne nan na.<verse eid="SNG 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Ɲaxanla falana a xɛmɛn xa:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 8:10"/>N tan luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:10">alo taan makantan yinna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:10">n xiɲɛne luxi alo sangansona.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:10">N luxi nɛn n ma xɛmɛn yɛɛ ra yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:10">alo ɲaxanla naxan fama bɔɲɛ xunbenla ra a xa.<verse eid="SNG 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 8:11"/>Manpa bili nakɔna nde yi Sulemani yii Baali-Hamon yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:11">a yi a taxu muxuna ndee ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:11">E birin yi fama gbeti gbanan wuli keden nan na a bogine saren na.<verse eid="SNG 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 8:12"/>N ma nakɔna n tan nan xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:12">A n yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:12">Na gbeti gbanan wuli kedenna i tan nan xa Sulemani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:12">i yi kɛmɛ firin so a kantan muxune yii.<verse eid="SNG 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Xɛmɛna falana a ɲaxanla xa:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 8:13"/>I tan naxan dɔxi nakɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:13">n lanfane tuli matixi i ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:13">I xuiin namini n xa a mɛ.<verse eid="SNG 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="sp">Ɲaxanla falana a xɛmɛn xa:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 8:14"/>N xanuntenna, i gi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:14">alo bolena hanma xɛli sɛnbɛmaan geyane fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:14">sansi xiri ɲaxumɛne dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="SNG 8:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 8"/>
</usx>
